      "writtenOn": "2021-06-16T19:12:25Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "Why does compiler.go:421 use MinSdkVersion instead of SdkVersion? Naively, I would think that it should be the latter because, well, the target of that variant is SdkVersion.",
