      "writtenOn": "2021-06-16T19:29:23Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "See the comments in the Sdk_version and Min_sdk_Version properties.  Sdk_version is for what APIs it should be built against, Min_sdk_version is the minimum version it needs to run on.  Any use of APIs that were added between Min_sdk_version and Sdk_version need to be guarded by runtime checks.  The Min_sdk_version becomes part of the clang triple, which is passed to clang using the -target option.  The Sdk_version is used to select which version of the NDK stub libraries to link against.",
      "parentUuid": "6fd74513_03a40c1f",
      "revId": "c4dc9b4f08226ff66830fcd8ec644ab82b66ca02",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
